{
 "note": "Stage play ball: ball_get -> ball_bounce (loop) -> ball_drop; a big striped beach ball. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (toys + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: the enter clip's frame 0 and the exit clip's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor. Stage play bubbles: bubbles_get -> bubbles_blow (loop) -> bubbles_put; a bottle + wand, baked bubbles (none at the loop seam). Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (toys + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: the enter clip's frame 0 and the exit clip's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor. Stage play yoyo: yoyo_get -> yoyo (loop, face layers from face_play.json set_clips, patch in face_patch_dir) -> yoyo_put. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (toys + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: the enter clip's frame 0 and the exit clip's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor. Stage play blocks: blocks_sit -> blocks_build (loop: three blocks stacked, the tower topples back to frame 0) -> blocks_stand. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (toys + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: the enter clip's frame 0 and the exit clip's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor. Stage play balloon: balloon_get -> balloon_bob (loop) -> balloon_let_go; the balloon is tethered to a toy weight, let go it springs back to the tether. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (toys + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: the enter clip's frame 0 and the exit clip's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor.",
